note right of Result
  * (student_id, session_id) la UNIQUE:
    1 ket qua / hoc sinh / ca thi
  * status la concurrency token
    (chong publish trung)
  * AI chi goi y - diem chinh thuc
    do KHAO THI quyet dinh
end note

note bottom of Rubric
  * 0 < max_score <= 100
  * 0 <= position < 20
end note

note bottom of Retake
  * 1 <= duration_minutes <= 240
  * (original_result_id) UNIQUE
  * (retake_session_id) UNIQUE
end note

@enduml
